></TD>\r\n<TD><FONT FACE=\"Arial\" SIZE=\"-1\">On Ordering the Previous Question</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD ALIGN=\"CENTER\"><FONT FACE=\"Arial\" SIZE=\"-1\">P</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD><FONT FACE=\"Arial\" SIZE=\"-1\">Providing for consideration of the bills (H.R. 6703) Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act; (H.R. 498) Do No Harm in Medicaid Act; and (H.R. 3492) Protect Childrens Innocence Act; and relating to consideration of the bill (H.R. 4776) SPEED Act</FONT></TD></TR>\r\n</TABLE><BR><FONT SIZE=\"3\">\r\n<A HREF=\"ROLL_300.asp\">Roll Calls 300 Thru 362</A><BR>\r\n<A HREF=\"ROLL_200.asp\">Roll Calls 200 Thru 299</A><BR>\r\n<A HREF=\"ROLL_100.asp\">Roll Calls 100 Thru 199</A><BR>\r\n<A HREF=\"ROLL_000.asp\">Roll Calls 1 Thru 99</A><BR>\r\n</FONT></BODY></HTML>\r\n"
